# Horizon 2050 UI

Load this skill when generating UI. Full tokens: repo `frontend-design-directive.md`. Agent skill: `.cursor/skills/flowdesk-ui/SKILL.md`.

- Dark canvas; glassmorphism (blur + translucent + luminous stroke). Real depth on auth via CSS 3D or R3F — not only drop-shadows.
- Accents: electric cyan + one of violet/plasma pink as **glow/rim**, not large flat fills. Max two hues per screen.
- Display/geometric headings with tracking; clean body font. Not Inter+indigo SaaS.
- Motion is functional: load choreography, springs, one cursor-reactive bit. **One** signature 3D/animated moment per screen.
- Auth = flagship shader/3D + floating glass form. Dashboards = same materials, **no** persistent WebGL behind data.
- Legible text (scrim/AA). `prefers-reduced-motion`. Degrade 3D on mobile.
